{"sha": "9e1a2e0a53f39394eb7501051ab4f2548a3918b14317114e7194a0e0f110de09", "body": ["\\begin{proposition}[拉回，线性情形]", "\\label{prop:b3:forms:linearpullback}", "线性映射 $u\\colon E \\to F$ 对每个 $k$ 诱导出", "线性映射 $u^*\\colon \\Lambda^kF^* \\to \\Lambda^kE^*$，", "$(u^*\\alpha)(v_1, \\dots, v_k) = \\alpha(u(v_1), \\dots,", "u(v_k))$。它满足 $u^*(\\alpha \\wedge \\beta) = u^*\\alpha", "\\wedge u^*\\beta$，且 $(u \\circ w)^* = w^* \\circ u^*$。", "此外：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 若 $\\dim E = n$ 且 $u\\colon E \\to E$，则在", "        直线 $\\Lambda^nE^*$ 上：$u^*\\alpha = (\\det u)\\,\\alpha$。", "  \\item 若 $\\operatorname{rk}u < k$，则 $u^* = 0$ 在", "        $\\Lambda^kF^*$ 上。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "函子性恒等式可直接由定义得出", "（对乘积法则，在 $1$-形式的楔积上", "用行列式公式验证 --- $\\det(\\ell_i(uv_j)) =", "\\det((u^*\\ell_i)(v_j))$ --- 再双线性扩张）。", "(1) $u^*$ 把一维的 $\\Lambda^nE^*$", "（\\cref{prop:b3:forms:basis}）映到自身，故 $u^*\\alpha =", "c\\,\\alpha$，其中 $c$ 与 $\\alpha \\neq 0$ 无关；取", "$\\alpha = e_1^* \\wedge \\dots \\wedge e_n^*$ 及 $(v_j) =", "(e_j)$ 检验，得 $c = \\det(e_i^*(ue_j)) = \\det u$。", "(2) 对 $v_1, \\dots, v_k \\in E$，向量 $u(v_1), \\dots,", "u(v_k)$ 位于 $u$ 的像中，维数 $< k$：它们", "线性相关，交错形式在相关族上", "取值为零（把相关向量沿", "其余向量展开）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\section{微分形式与外微分}", "", "\\begin{definition}\\label{def:b3:forms:diffform}", "设 $U \\subseteq \\R^n$ 为开集。称 \\emph{微分", "$k$-形式}\\index{微分形式}为 $U$ 上的光滑映射", "$\\omega\\colon U \\to \\Lambda^k(\\R^n)^*$；在", "\\cref{prop:b3:forms:basis} 的基下（记 $\\dd x_i$ 为", "$e_i^*$），", "\\[", "\\omega = \\sum_{\\abs I = k} a_I\\,\\dd x_I,", "\\qquad", "\\dd x_I = \\dd x_{i_1} \\wedge \\dots \\wedge \\dd x_{i_k},", "\\]", "其中系数 $a_I \\in \\mathcal C^\\infty(U)$ 均为光滑函数。", "其全体记为 $\\Omega^k(U)$；$\\Omega^0(U) = \\mathcal", "C^\\infty(U)$。$0$-形式即函数；$1$-形式是", "线性形式的场（例如函数的微分 $\\dd f$", "）；$n$-形式为 $a\\,\\dd x_1\\wedge\\dots\\wedge\\dd", "x_n$，即 \\cref{ch:b3:product} 中的自然被积对象。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{definition}[外微分]\\label{def:b3:forms:d}", "\\emph{外微分}\\index{外微分}是", "线性映射 $\\dd\\colon \\Omega^k(U) \\to \\Omega^{k+1}(U)$，", "由下式定义：", "\\[", "\\dd\\Bigl(\\sum_I a_I\\,\\dd x_I\\Bigr)", "= \\sum_I \\dd a_I \\wedge \\dd x_I", "= \\sum_I\\sum_{j=1}^n \\frac{\\partial a_I}{\\partial", "x_j}\\,\\dd x_j \\wedge \\dd x_I .", "\\]", "对 $0$-形式，它即通常的微分。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{theorem}\\label{thm:b3:forms:dsquare}", "(a) $\\dd(\\omega \\wedge \\eta) = \\dd\\omega \\wedge \\eta +", "(-1)^k\\,\\omega \\wedge \\dd\\eta$，对 $\\omega \\in \\Omega^k$", "（即 \\emph{分次莱布尼茨法则}）。", "(b) $\\dd \\circ \\dd = 0$。\\index{$\\dd^2 = 0$}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "(a) 由双线性性，只需考虑 $\\omega = a\\,\\dd", "x_I$，$\\eta = b\\,\\dd x_J$。于是 $\\omega \\wedge \\eta =", "ab\\,\\dd x_I \\wedge \\dd x_J$，且", "\\[", "\\dd(\\omega\\wedge\\eta) = (b\\,\\dd a + a\\,\\dd b) \\wedge \\dd x_I", "\\wedge \\dd x_J", "= (\\dd a \\wedge \\dd x_I) \\wedge (b\\,\\dd x_J) +", "a\\,\\dd b \\wedge \\dd x_I \\wedge \\dd x_J,", "\\]", "并将 $1$-形式 $\\dd b$ 越过 $k$ 个 $\\dd", "x_I$ 的因子，产生符号 $(-1)^k$（\\cref{def:b3:forms:wedgegeneral}）：", "第二项为 $(-1)^k\\,\\omega \\wedge \\dd\\eta$。", "(b) 对函数，$\\dd(\\dd a) = \\sum_{i,j}", "\\frac{\\partial^2a}{\\partial x_j\\partial x_i}\\,\\dd x_j \\wedge", "\\dd x_i$ 的系数关于 $(i,j)$ 对称，由", "施瓦茨定理（关于混合偏导数，在本科二年级分册中证明，", "$a$ 为 $\\mathcal C^\\infty$），而 $\\dd x_j \\wedge", "\\dd x_i$ 反对称：把 $(i,j)$ 项与", "$(j,i)$ 项配对，全部相消。对一般的 $\\omega = \\sum", "a_I\\dd x_I$：$\\dd\\dd\\omega = \\sum\\dd(\\dd a_I \\wedge \\dd x_I)", "= \\sum(\\dd\\dd a_I\\wedge\\dd x_I - \\dd a_I\\wedge\\dd(\\dd x_I))$", "由 (a)，两项均为零（$\\dd(\\dd x_I) = 0$，因为", "系数为常数）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[拉回]\\label{def:b3:forms:pullback}", "设 $\\varphi\\colon U \\to V$ 为光滑映射（$U \\subseteq \\R^m$，", "$V \\subseteq \\R^n$ 为开集）。称 \\emph{拉回}\\index{拉回}", "$\\varphi^*\\colon \\Omega^k(V) \\to \\Omega^k(U)$ 为映射，它", "逐点由沿微分的线性拉回定义：", "$(\\varphi^*\\omega)_x = (D\\varphi(x))^*\\,\\omega_{\\varphi(x)}$。", "具体地，$\\varphi^*$ 作代换：对函数，$\\varphi^*f = f \\circ", "\\varphi$；$\\varphi^*(\\dd y_i) =", "\\dd\\varphi_i = \\sum_j\\frac{\\partial\\varphi_i}{\\partial", "x_j}\\dd x_j$，且 $\\varphi^*(a\\,\\dd y_{i_1}\\wedge\\dots\\wedge", "\\dd y_{i_k}) =", "(a\\circ\\varphi)\\,\\dd\\varphi_{i_1}\\wedge\\dots\\wedge", "\\dd\\varphi_{i_k}$。", "\\end{definition}", ""]}